'''Bare Knuckles''' is a Fight-tree perk in ''[[Human Host]]''. The in-game display name may differ from this page title; the authoritative identifier is the runtime factor field name.

== Effect ==

Increases knockdown chance with bare fists and blunt weapons.

== Technical ==

Backing runtime factor: <code>_bareBluntHitDownProb_Factor</code> (type <code>Single</code>) on <code>Char_Skills</code> in the <code>Creature</code> assembly.

